    {
      "id": "F3A.YAN.A.RESCUE",
      "personality": 1,
      "text": "No sé cómo te llamas todavía... pero no quiero olvidar ese gesto tuyo. Gracias por soltar el lazo.",
      "emotion": "Relief",
      "intention": "n1_yan_a_rescue",
      "eventType": "FirstRescueCompleted",
      "lifeState": "Active",
      "topic": "",
      "orderVariant": "",
      "following": false,
      "group": "F3A.YAN.A.RESCUE",
      "scope": "encounter",
      "cooldown": 0,
      "priority": 70,
      "closure": "offer_topics_when_eligible",
      "options": [],
      "preferredExpression": "relaxed_if_validated",
      "fallbackExpression": "reset"
    },
    {
      "id": "F3A.YAN.B.TRAP.OPEN",
      "personality": 1,
      "text": "El lazo se cerró al pisar. Después solo podía oír el sendero sin ver bien quién pasaba. No quiero volver a sentirme así.",
      "emotion": "Concern",
      "intention": "answer_and_offer_choice",
      "eventType": "TopicSelected",
      "lifeState": "Active",
      "topic": "TRAP",
      "orderVariant": "",
      "following": false,
      "group": "F3A.YAN.B.TRAP.OPEN",
      "scope": "encounter",
      "cooldown": 0,
      "priority": 60,
      "closure": "await_player_choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "F3A.YAN.B.TRAP.CHOICE.DETAIL",
          "text": "¿Viste quién la puso?",
          "target": "F3A.YAN.B.TRAP.DETAIL"
        },
        {
          "id": "F3A.YAN.B.TRAP.CHOICE.SPACE",
          "text": "No tienes que explicarlo ahora.",
          "target": "F3A.YAN.B.TRAP.SPACE"
        }
      ],
      "preferredExpression": "sad_soft_if_validated",
      "fallbackExpression": "reset"
    },
    {
      "id": "F3A.YAN.B.TRAP.DETAIL",
      "personality": 1,
      "text": "No vi quién la dejó. Me entristece pensar que alguien preparó todo esto para una persona que ni siquiera conocía.",
      "emotion": "Sadness",
      "intention": "respond_without_creating_promise",
      "eventType": "PlayerOptionSelected",
      "lifeState": "Active",
      "topic": "TRAP",
      "orderVariant": "",
      "following": false,
      "group": "F3A.YAN.B.TRAP.DETAIL",
      "scope": "encounter",
      "cooldown": 0,
      "priority": 60,
      "closure": "complete_topic_and_return_to_topics",
      "options": [],
      "preferredExpression": "sad",
      "fallbackExpression": "reset"
    },
    {
      "id": "F3A.YAN.B.TRAP.SPACE",
      "personality": 1,
      "text": "Gracias por dejarlo ahí. Quiero decidir cuánto cuento, aunque me hayas ayudado.",
      "emotion": "Relief",
      "intention": "respect_silence",
      "eventType": "PlayerOptionSelected",
      "lifeState": "Active",
      "topic": "TRAP",
      "orderVariant": "",
      "following": false,
      "group": "F3A.YAN.B.TRAP.SPACE",
      "scope": "encounter",
      "cooldown": 0,
      "priority": 60,
      "closure": "complete_topic_and_return_to_topics",
      "options": [],
      "preferredExpression": "relaxed_if_validated",
      "fallbackExpression": "reset"
    },
    {
      "id": "F3A.YAN.B.FEEL.OPEN",
      "personality": 1,
      "text": "Estoy bien... No, mentira. Me asusté. Necesito alejarme del lazo, pero me distrae lo mucho que quiero saber de ti.",
      "emotion": "Concern",
      "intention": "n1_yan_b_feel_open",
      "eventType": "TopicSelected",
      "lifeState": "Active",
      "topic": "FEEL",
      "orderVariant": "",
      "following": false,
      "group": "F3A.YAN.B.FEEL.OPEN",
      "scope": "encounter",
      "cooldown": 0,
      "priority": 60,
      "closure": "await_player_choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "F3A.YAN.B.FEEL.CHOICE.BREATH",
          "text": "Puedes tomarte un momento.",
          "target": "F3A.YAN.B.FEEL.BREATH"
        },
        {
          "id": "F3A.YAN.B.FEEL.CHOICE.LATER",
          "text": "¿Prefieres que hablemos después?",
          "target": "F3A.YAN.B.FEEL.LATER"
        }
      ],
      "preferredExpression": "sad_soft_if_validated",
      "fallbackExpression": "reset"
    },
    {
      "id": "F3A.YAN.B.FEEL.BREATH",
      "personality": 1,
      "text": "Sí. Me vendrá bien quedarme un momento sin tener que fingir que ya estoy bien. Gracias por dejarme ese espacio.",
      "emotion": "Relief",
      "intention": "n1_yan_b_feel_breath",
      "eventType": "PlayerOptionSelected",
      "lifeState": "Active",
      "topic": "FEEL",
      "orderVariant": "",
      "following": false,
      "group": "F3A.YAN.B.FEEL.BREATH",
      "scope": "encounter",
      "cooldown": 0,
      "priority": 60,
      "closure": "complete_topic_and_return_to_topics",
      "options": [],
      "preferredExpression": "relaxed_if_validated",
      "fallbackExpression": "reset"
    },
    {
      "id": "F3A.YAN.B.FEEL.LATER",
      "personality": 1,
      "text": "Después. Quiero escucharte de verdad, y ahora sigo pendiente de lo que acaba de pasar.",
      "emotion": "Neutral",
      "intention": "n1_yan_b_feel_later",
      "eventType": "PlayerOptionSelected",
      "lifeState": "Active",
      "topic": "FEEL",
      "orderVariant": "",
      "following": false,
      "group": "F3A.YAN.B.FEEL.LATER",
      "scope": "encounter",
      "cooldown": 0,
      "priority": 60,
      "closure": "complete_topic_and_return_to_topics",
      "options": [],
      "preferredExpression": "reset",
      "fallbackExpression": "reset"
    },
    {
      "id": "F3A.YAN.B.ROAD.OPEN",
      "personality": 1,
      "text": "Quiero llegar a la aldea. Me gustaría saber si tú vas en la misma dirección, antes de seguir a alguien que acabo de conocer.",
      "emotion": "Neutral",
      "intention": "answer_and_offer_choice",
      "eventType": "TopicSelected",
      "lifeState": "Active",
      "topic": "ROAD",
      "orderVariant": "",
      "following": false,
      "group": "F3A.YAN.B.ROAD.OPEN",
      "scope": "encounter",
      "cooldown": 0,
      "priority": 60,
      "closure": "await_player_choice",
      "options": [
